 "notes": [
  "Posted 29 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting 7': Quiet Mining Colony (dested Quiet Mining Colony / Independent Operation), Bespin, Cloud City Guest Quarters, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Squadron Assignments, Keeping The Empire Out Forever and Your Insight Serves You Well; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Pucimyr Thryss' dested Pucumir Thryss; 'Bespin Cloud City' Bespin: Cloud City; 'Luke Skywalker Jedi Knight' Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight; 'It's A Trap' It's A Trap!.",
  "Weapon Levitation dested the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt; 'Aim high' dested the effect Aim High (in 2001 an effect, not a Defensive Shield).",
  "The section heading 'Admirals Orders 1' was parsed as a card and removed; its one card is I'll Take The Leader. Section counts 7+4+18+5+2+1+19+4 = 60."
